acceptance_criteria: "A direct-main commit that passed CI carries exact-commit DeepScan and CodeFactor evidence (or a declared equivalent hosted verdict) readable from the commit statuses or check-runs API; The scheduled auto-release run following a direct push to main cuts the release without a follow-up pull request, proven on a real commit; The hosted analysis gate names the evidence form it accepted for a direct-main head in its JSON receipt; pm-e70zh5's failing-stage breakdown records zero provenance refusals over the thirty scheduled runs after the fix lands"
